# CODEOWNERS — ownership made enforceable
#
# This file turns the persona ownership model into a GitHub-enforced review
# requirement. A change to a persona's namespace requires that persona's team.
#
# Replace @placeholders with real GitHub teams or usernames before enabling
# branch protection. Until then this file documents intent only.
#
# v0.1.0 · created 2026-08-06 · updated 2026-08-06 · owner TBD

# ---- Default ----
*                                       @framework-owners

# ---- Persona namespaces: each team owns its own ----
/.github/skills/sdlc-po-*/              @product-owners
/.github/prompts/sdlc-po-*              @product-owners

/.github/skills/sdlc-arch-*/            @solution-architects
/.github/prompts/sdlc-arch-*            @solution-architects

/.github/skills/sdlc-dev-*/             @dev-leads
/.github/prompts/sdlc-dev-*             @dev-leads

/.github/skills/sdlc-qe-*/              @qe-leads
/.github/prompts/sdlc-qe-*              @qe-leads

/.github/skills/sdlc-ops-*/             @devops-leads
/.github/prompts/sdlc-ops-*             @devops-leads

# ---- Shared surfaces: framework-owner review required ----
# These are what every other skill depends on. Changing them affects everyone.
/.github/copilot-instructions.md        @framework-owners
/.github/CODEOWNERS                     @framework-owners
/sdlc-copilot/template/                 @framework-owners
/sdlc-copilot/SKILLS.md                 @framework-owners

# ---- Context library: single named owner ----
# Stale guardrails do not fail loudly. They produce confident output built on
# last year's standard. This is the highest-consequence review in the repo.
/sdlc-copilot/context/                  @context-owner

# ---- Vendor-origin examples: platform review required ----
/.github/skills/sf-skills-*/            @salesforce-platform-owners
/.github/prompts/sf-skills-*            @salesforce-platform-owners
